# The five relationships, plus a dependency, each drawn with its own markers.
diagram flow=down

node Animal "Animal"
node Dog "Dog" below Animal
node Cat "Cat" right-of Dog
node Owner "Owner" left-of Dog
node Leg "Leg" below Dog
node Customer "Customer" below Owner
node Order "Order" below Leg
node Student "Student" right-of Order
node Course "Course" right-of Student
node Logger "Logger" above Cat

edge Dog extends Animal
edge Cat extends Animal
edge Dog composes Leg
edge Owner owns Dog
edge Customer one-to-many Order "places"
edge Student many-to-many Course "enrols in"
edge Cat depends-on Logger
